## How to name a tool on the wire

The **MCP tool** column in the capability index below is the exact name you put on the wire — it is **bare**: `search`, `expand`, `memory_write`. There is no `tool_` prefix and no `mcp-kairix__` prefix; those are documentation shorthands from older guides, not real tool names. If your client namespaces tools by server, it adds its own prefix — but the kairix-side name you pass is always the bare one shown here.

